[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3368463992","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111257#issuecomment-3368463992","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111257","id":3368463992,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Ixq54","user":{"login":"wheatear-dev","id":161692702,"node_id":"U_kgDOCaM8Hg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/161692702?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wheatear-dev","html_url":"https://github.com/wheatear-dev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wheatear-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wheatear-dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wheatear-dev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wheatear-dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wheatear-dev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wheatear-dev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wheatear-dev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wheatear-dev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wheatear-dev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-04T18:28:51Z","updated_at":"2025-10-04T18:28:51Z","body":"Using @dmlary 's MRP, I can reproduce this on every version of godot 4 that I tried.\n\nIncluding 4.0 (recording attached)\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cabae341-31e4-49ce-8639-fbc4c2b8cbc8\n\nSorry for the super low res, GitHub won't let me upload large files today.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3368463992/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3368494826","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111257#issuecomment-3368494826","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111257","id":3368494826,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Ixybq","user":{"login":"kleonc","id":9283098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODMwOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9283098?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc","html_url":"https://github.com/kleonc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-04T19:32:49Z","updated_at":"2025-10-04T19:33:28Z","body":"Switching to Jolt (`physics/3d/physics_engine` project setting) makes the issue go away (tested in v4.5.stable.official [876b29033]).\n\nSo this is specific to GodotPhysics3D.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3368494826/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3369052712","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111257#issuecomment-3369052712","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111257","id":3369052712,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Iz6oo","user":{"login":"rburing","id":229837,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyOTgzNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/229837?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing","html_url":"https://github.com/rburing","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-05T13:16:56Z","updated_at":"2025-10-05T13:16:56Z","body":"I added print statements before every `return` in the cylinder-face SAT function\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/06827c91c6ee98068a48c66be0cc067ebb434a2f/modules/godot_physics_3d/godot_collision_solver_3d_sat.cpp#L1915\n\nand it turns out it returns here:\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/06827c91c6ee98068a48c66be0cc067ebb434a2f/modules/godot_physics_3d/godot_collision_solver_3d_sat.cpp#L2016-L2025\n\nSo a workaround (for GodotPhysics3D) is to enable `backface_collision` on the `ConcavePolygonShape3D` (the `shape` resource of the `CollisionShape3D` of the cube).\n\nPerhaps `invert_backface_collision` should be `true` here, e.g. via the last argument here:\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/06827c91c6ee98068a48c66be0cc067ebb434a2f/modules/godot_physics_3d/godot_collision_solver_3d.cpp#L356\n\nThis fixes the issue in my testing, but I'm not sure if doing this unconditionally is a proper fix in general.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3369052712/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]